た日奈子だけど井上さんにも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声汚いって言ってた(つД`)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子は毒舌だから私はいつも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バカにされてしゅん。としてます笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11日のコントではまいちゅんと2人。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は人間観察で培ったファミレスの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生集団のJK特有の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノリを真似してみました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わった後楽しかったねってなった☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのコント見るの凄い好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽まで頑張るぞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃーんちゃーちゃーちゃちゃー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにジブリ博物館に行きたくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまらない今日この頃。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何だろう...あの細かいジブリ独特の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"描写！らここまで書く？っていう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くらいこだわっている所が素敵。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2014/06/13/6408739/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏には全国ツアーも決まって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の夏の事を思い出すなぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"zeep東京のステージで2期生だけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハウス、会いかもを披露させて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いただきました！懐かしいなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして千秋楽は代々木第一体育館で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表！初めて皆さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text"